+# Current scoring (after the 2026-08-17 decision)
+#   The i-th to die gets i points (**players killed by the same train are still ordered, the user decided to keep vanilla as is**)
+#   Survivors get dead_players.size() + 1 (only the disconnect hole is plugged, the gap is kept)
